WEBVTT

WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:10.680 --> 00:00:11.560
¿Papá?

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:13.960
Dad, are you okay?

00:00:14.720 --> 00:00:17.160
You’ve never called me that

00:00:17.640 --> 00:00:18.680
before,

00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:20.680
I need to tell you something.

00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:25.120
What is that?

00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:27.320
It was Selena.

00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:29.800
She and her mother, of course.

00:00:34.560 --> 00:00:35.720
It was them…

00:00:38.080 --> 00:00:38.720
You mean…?

00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:41.120
Yeah, they tried to kill me.

00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:44.480
But now,

00:00:45.720 --> 00:00:47.840
listen to me very carefully,

00:00:48.560 --> 00:00:49.640
my dear daughter.
